      "title": "Nation composition",
      "items": [
        "Fifteen native KMA replies keep legacy order, with city air branches removed.",
        "Fresh urban province means precede labelled representative-point fallback.",
        "Native children share the S16 captured-summary recorder; response bytes stay unchanged."
      ]
